msgid ""
msgstr ""

msgid "Ami「Hmm, she really isn't coming outside～」"
msgstr "Ami「Mmm, de verdad no sale～」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well yeah, I guess she really doesn't＿want people to find out she's back＿from America.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Pues sí, supongo que no quiere＿que la gente se entere de que＿volvió de Estados Unidos.」"

msgid "Taiga「In that case, we'll have to get into her＿house.」"
msgstr "Taiga「En ese caso, tendremos＿que entrar a su casa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Wait! Everything will get complicated if＿you do that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Espera! Todo se complicará＿si haces eso.」"

msgid "Ami「Takasu-kun, did you memorize the＿script I wrote you?」"
msgstr "Ami「Takasu-kun, ¿memorizaste el＿guion que te escribí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, for the most part, yeah.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, en su mayor parte, sí.」"

msgid "Ami「Counting on you. You're the only one＿who can have a decent conversation＿with that wicked, bossy tomboy.」"
msgstr "Ami「Cuento contigo. Eres el único capaz＿de tener una charla decente con esa＿marimacho malvada y mandona.」"

msgid "Ami「Go and coax out that villain. If it really＿gets out of hand, use your last resort①」"
msgstr "Ami「Ve y haz salir a esa villana.＿Si la cosa se sale de control,＿usa tu último recurso①」"

msgid "Ryuuji「My last resort?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mi último recurso?」"

msgid "Ami「Seduce her with your testosterone at＿full-throttle! Unbutton your shirt and＿flash her your belly button if you like!」"
msgstr "Ami「¡Sedúcela con tu testosterona a toda＿marcha! ¡Desabróchate la camisa y＿enséñale el ombligo si quieres!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Stop it. I'm not like Kitamura in the＿least! Sheesh. Don't put pressure on＿me. It'll just make me extra nervous.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Para. ¡No me parezco a Kitamura en lo＿más mínimo! Caray, no me presiones, que＿solo me pondrás más nervioso.」"

msgid "Ami「It feels like this really is the home＿stretch. I'm so excited～ ① Aren't you,＿Tiger?」"
msgstr "Ami「Se siente como si ya fuera＿la recta final. ¡Qué emoción～!＿① ¿No crees, Tigre?」"

msgid "Taiga「............」"
msgstr "Taiga「............」"

msgid "Ami「What? You sure clammed up. It's too＿late to say \"I don't want her and＿Yuusaku together after all\"......」"
msgstr "Ami「¿Qué? Qué callada te quedaste. Ya es＿tarde para decir: \"Después de todo no＿quiero que esté con Yuusaku\"......」"

msgid "Taiga「Ryuuji!!」"
msgstr "Taiga「¡¡Ryuuji!!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿Ah?!」"

msgid "Taiga「The true battle begins now. Keep calm＿and carry on.」"
msgstr "Taiga「La verdadera batalla empieza ahora.＿Mantén la calma y sigue adelante.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Oh, okay.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ah, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... is acting kinda weird......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Taiga...... actúa algo rara......）」"

msgid "Sumire「Sorry you had to come all this way.＿There's no need to apologize for＿yesterday.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Perdón por hacerte venir hasta＿aquí. No hace falta que te disculpes＿por lo de ayer.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Taiga did cause trouble by lashing out＿at you...... And there's something I want＿to bring to your attention.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Taiga sí causó problemas al lanzarse＿contra ti...... Y hay algo sobre＿lo que quiero advertirte.」"

msgid "Sumire「Fufu.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Juju.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Q-Qué?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Uh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Eh......」"

msgid "Sumire「I'm kidding. Sorry for interrupting you.＿Please continue.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Es broma. Perdón por interrumpirte.＿Por favor, continúa.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......It's about your little sister.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Es sobre tu hermana menor.」"

msgid "Sumire「About Sakura?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Sobre Sakura?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Apparently she's going to Luxure with＿Tomiie Kota tomorrow, or so I hear.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Al parecer mañana irá a Luxure con＿Tomiie Kota, o eso escuché.」"

msgid "Sumire「Luxure, huh? That's fine for high＿school students, isn't it? What's the＿issue?」"
msgstr "Sumire「Luxure, ¿eh? Está bien para unos＿estudiantes de preparatoria, ¿no?＿¿Cuál es el problema?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Specifically, it's the planetarium. I don't＿think you know about it since you've＿been in America, but it's dangerous.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「En concreto, es el planetario. No creo＿que lo conozcas por haber estado en＿Estados Unidos, pero es peligroso.」"

msgid "Sumire「......Dangerous?」"
msgstr "Sumire「......¿Peligroso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（Alright, she's taking the bait. All＿according to Kawashima's script.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（Bien, mordió el anzuelo. Todo＿según el guion de Kawashima.）」"

msgid "Sumire「............」"
msgstr "Sumire「............」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Two people pressed together in a＿loveseat, with the mood music playing,＿and the soothing aroma......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Dos personas muy juntas en un sofá＿doble, con música ambiental sonando＿y un aroma relajante......」"

msgid "Sumire「......What are you getting at?」"
msgstr "Sumire「......¿A dónde quieres llegar?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（......Blatant lies.）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（......Mentiras descaradas.）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「And Tomiie invited your little sister＿there...... Do you see what that means?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Y Tomiie invitó ahí a tu hermana＿menor...... ¿Entiendes lo que significa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Sakura-san is only a freshman, so I＿thought it might be best to let you＿know just in case, senpai......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sakura-san solo es de primer año,＿así que pensé que sería mejor avisarte＿por si acaso, senpai......」"

msgid "Sumire「What's the big deal?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Y qué tiene de malo?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......What!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......¡¿Qué?!」"

msgid "Sumire「I shot myself in the foot last time I＿worried myself over something like＿that. I learned my lesson.」"
msgstr "Sumire「La última vez que me preocupé por＿algo así, me salió el tiro por la＿culata. Aprendí la lección.」"

msgid "Sumire「Besides, Sakura isn't a child anymore.＿If I didn't trust my sister to make her＿own decisions, I could never have left.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Además, Sakura ya no es una niña. Si＿no confiara en que toma sus propias＿decisiones, nunca me habría ido.」"

msgid "Sumire「I appreciate your suspicion, but that's＿how I feel about it.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Aprecio tus reservas, pero＿así es como lo veo.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（T-This is bad...... Extremely bad! There's＿nothing about THIS in the script!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（E-Esto es malo...... ¡Muy malo! ¡No＿hay nada sobre ESTO en el guion!）」"

msgid "Sumire「By the way, Takasu, how's your health?」"
msgstr "Sumire「Por cierto, Takasu, ¿cómo va tu salud?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh? Uh, my memory still hasn't＿returned, but physically I'm just fine......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh? Bueno, mi memoria aún no vuelve,＿pero físicamente estoy muy bien......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Best of friends? How so?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Mejores amigos? ¿En qué sentido?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......I feel queasy just thinking about＿that.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......Me dan náuseas solo＿de pensar en eso.」"

msgid "Sumire「Now then. Are we done here?」"
msgstr "Sumire「Bien. ¿Ya terminamos aquí?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Ngh...... Uggh......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Ngh...... Uggh......」"

msgid "Sumire「What are you doing there with your＿shirt buttons?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Qué haces ahí con los＿botones de tu camisa?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I, I CAN'T! I mean, how could I possibly＿seduce Kanou-senpai?!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡N-NO PUEDO! O sea, ¡¿cómo diablos＿podría seducir a Kanou-senpai?!）」"

msgid "Sumire「You've been looking a little under the＿weather for a while now. Do you have＿food poisoning?」"
msgstr "Sumire「Llevas un rato con algo de mala＿cara. ¿Acaso te dio una intoxicación＿alimentaria?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「P-Please, Kanou-senpai, go with me to＿the planetarium tomorrow!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡P-Por favor, Kanou-senpai, ve＿conmigo al planetario mañana!」"

msgid "Sumire「Why are you so fixated on it?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Por qué estás tan obsesionado con eso?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Well, you see...... Oh!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Bueno, verás...... ¡Ah!」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I happen to have two tickets, so if I'm＿going I may as well take someone＿who's familiar with space, like you.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Resulta que tengo dos entradas, así＿que si voy, mejor llevo a alguien que＿sepa del espacio, como tú.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Never mind about your sister! Please＿spend the day with me! Think of it as＿community service! Just go with it!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Olvida a tu hermana! ¡Por favor pasa el＿día conmigo! ¡Piensa que es servicio＿comunitario! ¡Sígueme la corriente!」"

msgid "Sumire「............」"
msgstr "Sumire「............」"

msgid "Sumire「What the hell are you plotting?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿Qué demonios estás tramando?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......!」"

msgid "Sumire「......Alright, fine.」"
msgstr "Sumire「......De acuerdo, está bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Huh?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿Eh?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「D-Date!?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡¿C-Cita?!」"

msgid "Sumire「It's not? Then what is my role? Escort,＿nurse, role model, crossing guard, tour＿guide......?」"
msgstr "Sumire「¿No lo es? ¿Cuál es mi papel entonces?＿¿Escolta, enfermera, modelo a seguir,＿guardia escolar, guía turística......?」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It's a date!」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¡Es una cita!」"

msgid "Sumire「Then I look forward to tomorrow. I'll be＿sure to treat you right.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Entonces esperaré mañana con ganas.＿Me aseguraré de tratarte bien.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「S-See you then......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-Nos vemos entonces......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（T-That went well, somehow......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（S-Salió bien, de algún modo......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Basically, all I have to do is get Kanou＿Sumire to worry about her sister's＿innocence enough to go after her,」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Básicamente, solo tengo que lograr que＿Kanou Sumire tema por la inocencia de＿su hermana y vaya tras ella,」"

msgid "Ryuuji「right?」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「¿verdad?」"

msgid "Sumire「Well, I was thinking that phrase＿reminds me of a malevolent whisper to＿a governor.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Bueno, pensaba que esa frase＿me recuerda a un susurro malévolo＿a un gobernador.」"

msgid "Sumire「Like something Stephen King would＿write.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Como algo que escribiría Stephen King.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Yes. As you can imagine, the＿planetarium is dark. In addition, it's＿furnished with loveseats.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Sí. Como imaginarás, el planetario＿es oscuro. Además, está equipado＿con sofás dobles.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「It all sets a certain mood.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Todo crea cierto ambiente.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「W-What I'm getting at is, it's said that＿any couple who goes to that＿planetarium is guaranteed......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「A-A lo que voy es que se dice que＿toda pareja que va a ese planetario＿tiene asegurado......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「......to \"go all the way\" that same night.」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「......\"llegar hasta el final\"＿esa misma noche.」"

msgid "Sumire「I see. Based on what I saw yesterday, it＿would seem you're still best of friends＿with Aisaka.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Ya veo. Por lo que vi ayer,＿parece que tú y Aisaka siguen＿siendo mejores amigos.」"

msgid "Sumire「Even without your memories.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Incluso sin tus recuerdos.」"

msgid "Sumire「You two have quite the chemistry. I'm＿sure no matter how much amnesia you＿get......」"
msgstr "Sumire「Ustedes dos tienen mucha química.＿Seguro que sin importar cuánta＿amnesia tengas......」"

msgid "Sumire「......Your relationship will stay in an＿endless loop.」"
msgstr "Sumire「......Su relación seguirá＿en un bucle sin fin.」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（No, we're not! S-Since it's come to this,＿I'll take my chances and, just as＿Kawashima said......）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡No lo somos! Y-Ya que llegamos＿a esto, me arriesgaré y, tal como＿dijo Kawashima......）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「（I'll try Operation Bare Temptation......!）」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「（¡Intentaré la Operación Tentación＿al Desnudo......!）」"

msgid "Ryuuji「I, I haven't been able to remember＿much, so I was thinking maybe......」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「N-No he podido recordar mucho, así que＿estaba pensando que tal vez......」"

msgid "Ryuuji「Maybe it's not enough to just hang＿around the same people all the time～」"
msgstr "Ryuuji「Tal vez no baste con pasar el rato con＿las mismas personas todo el tiempo～」"

msgid "Sumire「I'm the former Oohashi student council＿president, after all. I couldn't turn＿down someone in need.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Después de todo, fui presidenta del＿consejo estudiantil de Oohashi. No＿podría rechazar a alguien en apuros.」"

msgid "Sumire「Alright, I'll go on a date with you＿tomorrow.」"
msgstr "Sumire「Está bien, tendré una＿cita contigo mañana.」"
